{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00797","headline":"郊庙歌辞 梁太庙乐舞辞 皇帝行 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 梁太庙乐舞辞 皇帝行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫高者天，攀跻弗克。\n隮天有方，累仁积德。\n祖宗隆之，子孙履之。\n配天明祀，永永孝思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00797.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00797","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}